  "title": "Hot Chicken Wing Dip",
  "description": "This hot chicken wing dip recipe gives you the flavor of hot chicken wings dipped in ranch dressing and covered in cheese. Serve it with chips or crackers.",
  "authors": [
    "Shauna"
  ],
